  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "A lot of streamers enjoy having fairly high quality avatars for local use, but are restricted in doing so due to needing to stay within performance constraints when streaming with friends/their community/etc.\n\nHaving a system that allows you to have one avatar worn locally, while another is worn for remote players, in order to allow for a higher quality local avatar for streaming etc would be very useful for this. Maybe a way to whitelist so you can load specific peoples high res avatars would be good here.\n\nThe current impostor system doesn't work here due to the fact that you can't hand-craft the imposters - they are auto-generated. This causes problems for toggles for outfit changes and other animation-related gimmicks for streamers with such systems, so allowing for this to be hand-crafted would be useful.",
